+## Architecture Mapper — Voice Loading Flow (2026-09-02)
+
+When the user says "open architecture mapper", NEXUS now follows the same
+loading-indicator pattern as the sidebar/worker flow:
+
+1. **Immediately** speaks "On it sir" (fire-and-forget TTS)
+2. **Immediately** hides the orb + shows `loading.json` at top-right corner
+3. Runs repository detection + Phase 1 + AI enrichment in the background
+4. Opens the architecture window only after all analysis is complete
+5. Hides the loading indicator + speaks "Here is the architecture, sir."
+
+**Key fix:** The loading indicator is shown **immediately** — it does NOT
+wait for TTS to finish. The old code used `speak().then(() =>
+showLoadingIndicator())` which delayed the indicator by ~1.7s (Kokoro
+load time) or never showed it if the state check failed.
+
+**File:** `frontend/src/audio/recorder.ts` — both `open_architect` branches
+updated to use fire-and-forget pattern. See
+[Feature 33](docs/features/33-architecture-mapper-voice-loading-flow.md).
+
+## Architecture Mapper — Layout Redesign (2026-09-02)
+
+The architecture mapper window was redesigned:
+
+- **3 view tabs** in the header: Files, Hotspots (N), Cycles (N)
+- **Full-width map** — no floating sidebar overlay
+- **2-row bottom section:**
+  - Row 1 (110px): File Inspector (file path, risk, dependents/dependencies,
+    impact analysis, imported by, imports)
+  - Row 2 (fills): Analytics list (changes based on selected view tab)
+- Removed: stat pills, floating `ArchitectSidebar` overlay, 2-column layout
+
+**File:** `frontend/src/architect/ArchitectApp.tsx`, `frontend/src/architect/architect.css`
+See [Feature 34](docs/features/34-architecture-mapper-layout-redesign.md).
+
